{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Wire OTLP → Prometheus or Grafana Cloud after OTEL metrics export.",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {"type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --"},
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### RCM Guardian — Denial forecasting (template)\n\nInstrument FastAPI and LangGraph with OpenTelemetry: expose histograms (e.g. `rcm.auditor.confidence`), counters for `rcm.findings` labeled by `finding_kind` (e.g. `PRIOR_AUTH_GAP`), and route-level latency. Map OTLP metrics to Prometheus recording rules, then replace the placeholder queries in this dashboard.\n\n**Panels:** auditor confidence trend, prior-auth gap and HITL rates, 24h PA-gap counts, mean confidence, and graph node latency (examples only until metrics exist).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(rcm_auditor_confidence_bucket)",
          "legendFormat": "Auditor confidence (placeholder)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Auditor confidence trend",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(rcm_finding_total{finding_kind=\"PRIOR_AUTH_GAP\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Prior-auth gaps / sec",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(rcm_route_human_review_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HITL interrupts / sec",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Denial-risk signals (PA gaps vs HITL)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short"},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "id": 4,
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(rcm_finding_total{finding_kind=\"PRIOR_AUTH_GAP\",status=\"REJECTED\"}[24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "24h PA-gap findings (REJECTED)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1}},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 13},
      "id": 5,
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["mean"]}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(rcm_auditor_confidence)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Mean confidence (rolling)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}},
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 13},
      "id": 6,
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["mean"]}},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(rcm_graph_duration_seconds_bucket[15m])) by (le, node))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "p95 graph node latency (placeholder)",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
